/ One save button for the desktop, which the form-dirty controller enables.
  Disabled from the start, as the form-dirty controller sets it on connect.
  Else it shows enabled until the controller connects. A phone has the save
  button in the title bar instead (see Ui::TitleBar::Component).

  The save button comes first in the form, because Enter in a field submits
  with the first submit button. It moves to the right edge with order-last,
  the delete button to the left edge with order-first. The discard button
  stands next to the save button and shows with it, as in Ui::SaveBar. It
  resets the form to the values of the page.
.flex.items-center.justify-end.gap-3.mt-6.max-lg:hidden
  button.peer.order-last class=BUTTON_CLASS type="submit" disabled=true data-form-dirty-submit=true
    = icon 'check'
    = label
  button.rounded.p-2.text-gray-500.hover:text-gray-700.hover:bg-gray-100.dark:text-gray-400.dark:hover:text-gray-200.dark:hover:bg-slate-700.transition.duration-200.peer-disabled:invisible.peer-disabled:opacity-0.focus:outline-none.focus-visible:ring-2.focus-visible:ring-indigo-500[
    type='reset'
    title=t('crud.discard')
    aria-label=t('crud.discard')
    data-controller='tooltip'
  ]
    = icon 'xmark', class: 'fa-fw'
  - if delete_path
    = render Ui::Button::Component.new icon: 'trash',
                                       type: :submit,
                                       style: :secondary,
                                       options: { \
                                         **delete_options,
                                         title: t('crud.delete'),
                                         data: { **Ui::ConfirmDialog::Component.delete_data, controller: 'tooltip' },
                                         class: 'order-first mr-auto text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 hover:text-orange-500 dark:hover:text-orange-500',
                                       }
/ A phone has the delete button as a red line of its own below the fields
- if delete_path
  .mt-8.lg:hidden
    = button_tag t('crud.delete'),
                 type: :submit,
                 **delete_options,
                 data: Ui::ConfirmDialog::Component.delete_data,
                 class: 'w-full rounded-xl py-3 text-headline bg-white text-signal-negative active:bg-gray-200 dark:bg-slate-800/60 dark:active:bg-slate-700/60 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-red-500'
